# "Merfolk" is a creature type word in Lord of Atlantis's type line and in "Other Merfolk get +1/+1 and have islandwalk"
# (CR 612.2), so Artificial Evolution - not Mind Bend, which offers no creature types - may replace it with Elf (CR 612.1,
# layer 3). The Lord is then an Elf, and its ability says "Other Elves": Bot1's Llanowar Elves is 2/2 with islandwalk, and
# Bot1's Hullbreacher, a Merfolk, is a plain 3/2 again.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Lord of Atlantis
Llanowar Elves
Hullbreacher
Artificial Evolution
Island x11

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest x20

